Maintainer: Scrumpper <190908034+Scrumpper@users.noreply.github.com>
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: h96-kernel-switch
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: systemd, initramfs-tools-core, u-boot-tools
Description: H96 MAX V58 kernel switch with boot guard and rollback
 Copies kernel staged by h96-kernel package into /boot under versioned
 names, switches Image and uInitrd links, and arms boot guard that falls
 back to previous kernel unless trial boot is confirmed. Rollback and
 prune commands. Package itself writes nothing under /boot; only command
 run by administrator does.
